我为什么还要找个像我这样的女人呢
Why would I want to be with someone like me?

368
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:28,370
你懂我的意思
You know what I mean.

369
00:16:28,940 --> 00:16:30,770
也许我的某些反应
And, you know, maybe the way I've been reacting

370
