and just be together?

374
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:43,840
这主意不错
That sounds nice.

375
00:16:44,610 --> 00:16:45,650
好的
Good.

376
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:48,180
因为
Because...

377
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,860
自从见到你的那一刻  我便爱上了你
I've loved you since the moment we met,

378
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:53,870
我会一辈子爱你  至死不渝
and I will keep loving you until the end of time.

379
00:16:55,230 --> 00:16:56,980
天啊  这是我听过
Oh, my God, that is the most beautiful thing

380
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:59,680
-最美的情话  -是吗
- anyone's ever said to me. - Yeah?

381
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,680
那是因为你那么美
That's because you're beautiful,

382
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:07,860
美到我心中满溢着爱与歌
and your beauty fills my heart with love and song.

383
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:11,910
越说越烂俗了哦  莱纳德
It's getting kind of cheesy, Leonard.

384
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,730
还有更烂俗的呢  准备好了
If you think that's cheesy, buckle up.

385
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:19,440
佩妮·霍夫斯塔德
Penny Hofstadter,

386
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:21,740
你愿意跟我维持婚姻吗
will you please stay married to me?

387
00:17:22,810 --> 00:17:24,790
讨厌  你的烂俗再创新高峰了
Oh, damn it, you topped it.

388
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:30,330
是不是该入洞房  把成亲最后一步给"办"了
Should we go to the bedroom and make this marriage official?

389
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:31,880
-好  拜托了  -好的
- Yes, please! Okay! - Okay.

390
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:41,200
谢尔顿  没想到你会送我们结婚礼物
