这有什么好惊讶的
I don't know why you're so surprised.

392
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:45,740
我看电影  看得到别人怎么做
I watch movies; I see what people do.

393
00:17:47,390 --> 00:17:48,270
这是什么
What is this?

394
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:50,330
周末往返旧金山的机票
Plane tickets and hotel reservations

395
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:52,510
